<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="EZR" style="id"/>
  <para style="h">Esdras</para>
  <para style="toc1">ESDRAS</para>
  <para style="toc2">Esdras</para>
  <para style="toc3">Esd</para>
  <para style="mt1">ESDRAS</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="EZR 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 1:1"/>Alò, nan premye ane Cyrus, wa a Perse la, pou pawòl SENYÈ a te kab akonpli pa bouch a Jérémie, SENYÈ a te vire lespri a Cyrus, wa Perse la, pou l te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 5:13">Esd 5:13</ref></char></note>voye yon pwoklamasyon toupatou nan wayòm li an, e anplis pou l ta ekri li pou te di:<verse eid="EZR 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="mi">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 1:2"/>“Konsa pale Cyrus, wa a Perse la, ‘SENYÈ a, Bondye Syèl la, te ban mwen tout wayòm yo sou latè epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 44:28">És 44:28</ref></char></note>Li te chwazi mwen pou bati yon kay pou Li Jérusalem, ki nan Juda. <verse eid="EZR 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 1:3"/>Nenpòt moun ki pami nou nan tout pèp li a, ke Bondye pa li a kapab avèk li! Lese l monte Jérusalem ki nan Juda pou rebati lakay SENYÈ a, Bondye Israël la <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 37:16">És 37:16</ref></char></note>(Se Li ki Bondye), ki nan Jérusalem nan. <verse eid="EZR 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 1:4"/>Nenpòt nan yo ki toujou vivan, nenpòt kote ke li ta rete, kite moun nan plas sa yo bay li soutyen avèk ajan avèk lò, avèk byen ak bèt, ansanm avèk yon ofrann bòn volonte pou lakay Bondye ki Jérusalem nan.’”<verse eid="EZR 1:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 1:5"/>Epi chèf lakay papa zansèt pa yo nan Juda avèk Benjamin, e prèt avèk Levit yo te leve, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 1:1-2">Esd 1:1-2</ref></char></note> menm tout sila ki te gen lespri vire pa Bondye yo, pou monte rebati lakay SENYÈ a ki Jérusalem nan. <verse eid="EZR 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 1:6"/>Tout sila ki te antoure yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 6:9">Né 6:9</ref></char></note> ankouraje yo avèk bagay an ajan, lò, byen pa yo, bèt yo, bagay yo koute chè pa yo, apati de tout sa ki te bay kon ofrann bòn volonte. <verse eid="EZR 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 1:7"/>Anplis, Wa Cyrus te mennen fè sòti tout bagay ki te pou lakay SENYÈ a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 24:13">II Wa 24:13</ref></char></note> ke Nebucadnetsar te mennen fè sòti Jérusalem pou mete lakay dye a li menm yo; <verse eid="EZR 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 1:8"/>menm sa yo Cyrus, wa Perse la, te fè sòti pa men Mithredath, trezorye a e li menm, te konte yo pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 5:14">Esd 5:14</ref></char></note> Sheshbatsar, prens a Juda a. <verse eid="EZR 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 1:9"/>Men kontwòl yo: trant <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 8:27">Esd 8:27</ref></char></note> asyèt an lò, mil asyèt an ajan, vent-nèf kouto; <verse eid="EZR 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 1:10"/>trant bòl an lò, kat-san-dis bòl an ajan nan yon lòt kalite ak mil nan lòt atik. <verse eid="EZR 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 1:11"/>Tout bagay an lò avèk ajan yo te vin kontwole nan senk-mil-kat-san. Sheshbatsar te mennen yo tout monte avèk moun egzil ki te sòti Babylone yo pou rive Jérusalem.<verse eid="EZR 1:11"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="EZR 2"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 2:1"/>Alò, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 24:14-16">II Wa 24:14-16</ref></char></note> sila yo se moun pwovens ki te vin sòti an kaptivite kon moun egzil ke Nebucadnetsar, wa Babylone nan, te pote ale Babylone e te gen tan retounen Jérusalem avèk Juda, yo chak nan pwòp vil pa yo. <verse eid="EZR 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 2:2"/>Sila yo te vini avèk Zorobabel, Josué, Néhémie, Seraja, Reélaja, Mardochée, Bilschan, Mispar, Bigtvaï, Rehum ak Baana.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EZR 2:2">Fòs kantite mesye nan pèp Israël yo: <verse eid="EZR 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 2:3"/>Fis a Pareosch yo, de-mil-san-swasann-douz. <verse eid="EZR 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 2:4"/>Fis a Schephathia yo, twa-san-swasann-douz. <verse eid="EZR 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 2:5"/>Fis Arach yo: sèt-san-swasann-kenz; <verse eid="EZR 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 2:6"/>fis a Pachath-Moab nan fis a Josué avèk Joab yo: de-mil-ui-san-douz. <verse eid="EZR 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 2:7"/>Fis Élam yo: mil-de-san-senkant-kat. <verse eid="EZR 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 2:8"/>Fis Zatthu yo: nèf-san-karant-senk. <verse eid="EZR 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 2:9"/>Fis Zaccaï yo: sèt-san-swasant; <verse eid="EZR 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 2:10"/>fis Bani yo: sis-san-karant-de, <verse eid="EZR 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 2:11"/>Fis Bébaï yo: sis-san-venn-twa. <verse eid="EZR 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 2:12"/>Fis Azgad yo: mil-de-san-venn-de. <verse eid="EZR 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 2:13"/>Fis Adonikam yo: sis-san-swasann-sis. <verse eid="EZR 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZR 2:14"/>Fis Bigvaï yo: de-mil-senkant-sis. <verse eid="EZR 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZR 2:15"/>Fis Adin yo: kat-san-senkant-kat. <verse eid="EZR 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZR 2:16"/>Fis Ather nan fanmi Ézéchias yo: katreven-dizuit. <verse eid="EZR 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZR 2:17"/>Fis Betsaï yo: twa-san-venn-twa. <verse eid="EZR 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZR 2:18"/>Fis Jora yo: san-douz. <verse eid="EZR 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZR 2:19"/>Fis Haschum yo: de-san-venn-twa. <verse eid="EZR 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZR 2:20"/>Fis Guibbar yo: katra-ven-kenz. <verse eid="EZR 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZR 2:21"/>Mesye a Bethléem yo: san-venn-twa. <verse eid="EZR 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZR 2:22"/>Mesye a Nethopha yo: senkant-sis. <verse eid="EZR 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZR 2:23"/>Mesye Anathoth yo: san-venn-tuit. <verse eid="EZR 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZR 2:24"/>Fis Azmaveth yo: karann-de. <verse eid="EZR 2:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZR 2:25"/>Fis a Kirjath-Arim yo, Kephira, avèk Beéroth yo; sèt-san-karann-twa. <verse eid="EZR 2:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZR 2:26"/>Fis a Rama avèk Guéba yo: sis-san-venteyen. <verse eid="EZR 2:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZR 2:27"/>Mesye a Micmas yo: san-venn-de. <verse eid="EZR 2:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZR 2:28"/>Mesye a Béthel avèk Aï yo: de-san-venn-twa. <verse eid="EZR 2:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZR 2:29"/>Fis a Nebo yo: senkant-de. <verse eid="EZR 2:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZR 2:30"/>Fis a Magbisch yo: san-senkant-sis. <verse eid="EZR 2:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZR 2:31"/>Fis a lòt Élam nan: mil-de-san-senkant-kat. <verse eid="EZR 2:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EZR 2:32"/>Fis a Harim yo: twa-san-ven. <verse eid="EZR 2:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EZR 2:33"/>Fis a Lod, Hadid ak Ono yo: sèt-san-venn-senk. <verse eid="EZR 2:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EZR 2:34"/>Fis a Jéricho yo, twa-san-karann-senk. <verse eid="EZR 2:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EZR 2:35"/>Fis a Senaa yo: twa-mil-sis-san-trant.<verse eid="EZR 2:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="EZR 2:36"/>Prèt yo; fis a Jedaeja lakay Josué yo: nèf-san-swasann-trèz. <verse eid="EZR 2:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EZR 2:37"/>Fis a Immer yo: mil-senkant-de; <verse eid="EZR 2:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EZR 2:38"/>fis a Paschhur yo: mil-de-san-karann-sèt. <verse eid="EZR 2:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="EZR 2:39"/>Fis a Harim yo: mil-disèt.<verse eid="EZR 2:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="EZR 2:40"/>Levit yo: fis a Josué yo, fis a Kadmiel yo e fis a Hodavia yo: swasann-katòz. <verse eid="EZR 2:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="EZR 2:41"/>Chantè yo: fis a Asaph yo: san-venn-tuit. <verse eid="EZR 2:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="EZR 2:42"/>Fis a gadyen yo: Fis a Schallum yo, fis a Ather yo, fis a Thalmon yo, fis a Akkub yo, fis a Hathitha yo e fis a Schobaï yo an total: san-trant-nèf.<verse eid="EZR 2:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="EZR 2:43"/>Netinyen yo: fis a Tsicha yo, fis a Hasupha yo, avèk fis a Thabbaoth yo, <verse eid="EZR 2:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="EZR 2:44"/>fis a Kéros yo, fis a Siaha yo, avèk fis a Padon yo, <verse eid="EZR 2:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="EZR 2:45"/>fis a Lebana yo, fis a Hagaba yo, fis a Akkub yo, <verse eid="EZR 2:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="EZR 2:46"/>fis a Hagab yo, fis a Schamlaï yo, fis a Hanan yo, <verse eid="EZR 2:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="EZR 2:47"/>fis a Guiddel yo, fis a Gachar yo, fis a Reaja yo, <verse eid="EZR 2:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="EZR 2:48"/>fis a Retsin yo, fis a Nekoda yo, fis a Gazzam yo, <verse eid="EZR 2:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="EZR 2:49"/>fis a Uzza yo, fis a Peséach yo, fis a Bésaï yo, <verse eid="EZR 2:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="EZR 2:50"/>fis a Asna yo, fis a Mehunim yo, fis a Nephusim yo, <verse eid="EZR 2:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="EZR 2:51"/>fis a Bakbuk yo, fis a Hakupha yo, fis a Harhur yo, <verse eid="EZR 2:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="EZR 2:52"/>fis a Batsluth yo, fis a Mehida yo, fis a Harscha yo, <verse eid="EZR 2:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="EZR 2:53"/>fis a Barkos yo, fis a Sisera yo, fis a Thamach yo, <verse eid="EZR 2:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="EZR 2:54"/>fis a Netsaich yo, fis a Hathipha yo.<verse eid="EZR 2:54"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="EZR 2:55"/>Fis a sèvitè Salomon yo: fis a Sothaï yo, fis a Sophéreth yo, fis a Peruda yo, <verse eid="EZR 2:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="EZR 2:56"/>fis a Jaala yo, fis a Darkon yo, fis a Guiddel yo, <verse eid="EZR 2:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="EZR 2:57"/>fis a Schephathia yo, fis a Hatthil yo, fis a Pokéreth-Hatesbaïm yo, fis a Ami yo. <verse eid="EZR 2:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="EZR 2:58"/>Tout sèvitè tanp lan avèk <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:58 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 9:21">I Wa 9:21</ref></char></note>fis a sèvitè Salomon yo te twa-san-katreven-douz.<verse eid="EZR 2:58"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="EZR 2:59"/>Alò, sa yo se sila ki te monte sòti Thel-Mélach, Thel-Harscha, Kerub-Addan, avèk Imher ki pa t kapab bay prèv selon lakay zansèt pa yo, ke se moun Israël yo te ye: <verse eid="EZR 2:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="EZR 2:60"/>Fis a Delaja yo, fis a Tobija yo, fis a Nekoda yo, sis-san-senkant-de. <verse eid="EZR 2:60"/><verse number="61" style="v" sid="EZR 2:61"/>Epi pami fis a prèt yo: fis a Habaja yo, fis a Hakkots yo, fis a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:61 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 17:21">II Sam 17:21</ref></char></note> Barzillaï yo, ki te pran pou madanm li youn nan fi a Barzillaï yo, Gadit la e te rele pa non pa yo. <verse eid="EZR 2:61"/><verse number="62" style="v" sid="EZR 2:62"/>Sila yo te fè rechèch pami anrejistreman zansèt pa yo, men yo pa t kab twouve yo; <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:62 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 16:39-40">Nonb 16:39-40</ref></char></note> akoz sa, yo te konsidere pa pwòp e te anpeche fè sèvis kon prèt. <verse eid="EZR 2:62"/><verse number="63" style="v" sid="EZR 2:63"/>Gouvènè a te pale yo pou pa manje bagay ki sen pase tout lòt bagay yo jiskaske yon prèt te kanpe avèk <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:63 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 28:30">Egz 28:30</ref></char></note>Ourim nan ak Toumim nan.<verse eid="EZR 2:63"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" sid="EZR 2:64"/>Tout asanble a te kontwole a karann-de-mil-twa-san-swasant moun, <verse eid="EZR 2:64"/><verse number="65" style="v" sid="EZR 2:65"/>anplis, sèvitè gason ak fanm pa yo ki te kontwole nan sèt-mil-twa-san-trann-sèt; epi yo te gen de-san <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:65 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 35:25">II Kwo 35:25</ref> </char></note>chantè, ni gason ni fanm. <verse eid="EZR 2:65"/><verse number="66" style="v" sid="EZR 2:66"/>Cheval yo te kontwole nan sèt-san-trann-sis e milèt yo nan de-san-karann-senk. <verse eid="EZR 2:66"/><verse number="67" style="v" sid="EZR 2:67"/>Chamo yo te kat-san-trann-senk, avèk bourik yo nan si-mil-sèt-san-ven.<verse eid="EZR 2:67"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="EZR 2:68"/>Kèk nan chèf lakay zansèt yo, lè yo te rive lakay SENYÈ a, ki Jérusalem nan, yo te fè ofrann bòn volonte a pou l ta rekonstwi fondasyon li yo. <verse eid="EZR 2:68"/><verse number="69" style="v" sid="EZR 2:69"/>Selon kapasite pa yo, yo te bay <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:69 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 8:25-34">Esd 8:25-34</ref></char></note> nan kès la sòm a swasann-te-yen-mil drakma an lò, senk-mil min an ajan, avèk san vètman pou prèt yo.<verse eid="EZR 2:69"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="EZR 2:70"/>Alò prèt yo avèk Levit yo, kèk nan moun yo, chantè yo, gadyen pòtay yo avèk sèvitè tanp yo te rete nan vil pa yo e tout Israël nan vil pa yo.<verse eid="EZR 2:70"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="EZR 3"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 3:1"/>Alò, lè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 7:73">Né 7:73</ref></char></note> setyèm mwa a te fin rive e fis Israël yo te nan vil yo, pèp la, kon yon sèl moun, te reyini ansanm Jérusalem. <verse eid="EZR 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 3:2"/>Konsa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 12:1-8">Né 12:1-8</ref> </char></note> Josué, fis a Jotsadak la avèk frè li yo, prèt yo e Zorobabel, fis a Schealthiel la avèk frè li yo, te leve e te bati lotèl Bondye Israël la pou ofri ofrann brile sou li, kon sa ekri nan lalwa Moïse la, nonm Bondye a. <verse eid="EZR 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 3:3"/>Pou sa, yo te mete lotèl la sou fondasyon li, malgre <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 4:4">Esd 4:4</ref></char></note> yo te krent anpil akoz pèp a nasyon yo, epi yo te ofri ofrann brile yo sou li a SENYÈ a, ofrann brile nan maten ak nan aswè. <verse eid="EZR 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 3:4"/>Yo te selebre Fèt Tonèl yo kon sa ekri a, e te fè fòs kantite ofrann brile ki te etabli chak jou yo, selon obligasyon chak jou ke òdonans lan egzije yo; <verse eid="EZR 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 3:5"/>epi apre, te genyen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 29:38">Egz 29:38</ref></char></note> yon ofrann brile san rete. Anplis, pou nouvèl lin e pou tout fèt SENYÈ a ki te òdone e konsakre yo, e soti nan tout moun ki te ofri yon ofrann bòn volonte a SENYÈ a. <verse eid="EZR 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 3:6"/>Soti nan premye jou nan setyèm mwa a, yo te kòmanse ofri ofrann brile a SENYÈ a, men fondasyon tanp lan potko poze. <verse eid="EZR 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 3:7"/>Yo te vèse bay lajan a mason yo avèk chapant yo avèk manje, bagay pou bwè, lwil pou Sidonyen avèk Tiryen yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 2:16">II Kwo 2:16</ref></char></note> pou pote bwa sèd sòti Liban pou rive nan lanmè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 9:36">Trav 9:36</ref></char></note>Japho a, selon pèmisyon ke yo te resevwa soti nan Cyrus, wa Perse la.<verse eid="EZR 3:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 3:8"/>Alò, nan dezyèm ane a, depi yo te rive lakay Bondye Jérusalem nan dezyèm mwa a, Zorobabel, fis a Schealthiel la avèk Josué, fis a Jotsadak la avèk tout lòt frè pa yo, prèt yo avèk Levit yo e tout moun ki te vini soti an kaptivite pou rive Jérusalem, te kòmanse èv la e te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 23:4-24">I Kwo 23:4-24</ref> </char></note> apwente Levit yo ak laj a ventan oswa plis pou sipèvize travay lakay SENYÈ a. <verse eid="EZR 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 3:9"/>Konsa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 2:40">Esd 2:40</ref></char></note> Josué avèk fis li yo ak frè li yo te kanpe ansanm avèk Kadmiel ak fis pa li yo, fis a Juda yo, fis a Hénadad yo avèk fis pa yo ak frè yo, Levit yo, pou sipèvize ouvriye nan tanp Bondye a.<verse eid="EZR 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 3:10"/>Alò, lè ouvriye yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 4:6-10">Za 4:6-10</ref></char></note> fin poze fondasyon tanp SENYÈ a, prèt yo te kanpe ak vètman pa yo avèk twonpèt yo, e Levit yo, fis a Asaph yo, avèk senbal yo, pou louwe SENYÈ a selon enstriksyon a Wa David de Israël la. <verse eid="EZR 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 3:11"/>Yo te chante, te fè lwanj e te bay remèsiman a SENYÈ a. Yo te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 100:5">Sòm 100:5</ref></char></note> “Li bon, Paske lanmou dous Li sou Israël jis pou tout tan.” Epi tout pèp la te leve yon gran kri anlè lè yo te louwe SENYÈ a, akoz fondasyon lakay SENYÈ a te fin poze.<verse eid="EZR 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 3:12"/>Men anpil nan prèt yo avèk Levit yo avèk chèf lakay zansèt yo, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HAG 2:3">Ag 2:3</ref></char></note> ansyen granmoun ki te konn wè premye tanp lan, te kriye avèk yon gran vwa lè fondasyon a kay sila a te poze devan zye yo. Anpil nan yo te rele fò avèk jwa, <verse eid="EZR 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 3:13"/>jiskaske pèp la pa t kab distenge antre son lajwa ak son kriye a pèp la, paske pèp la te rele ak gran vwa e son lan te koute soti byen lwen.<verse eid="EZR 3:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="EZR 4"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 4:1"/>Alò, lè lènmi a Juda yo avèk Benjamin yo te tande ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 1:11">Esd 1:11</ref></char></note> moun egzil yo t ap bati yon tanp a SENYÈ a, Bondye Israël la, <verse eid="EZR 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 4:2"/>yo te pwoche Zorobabel avèk chèf lakay zansèt yo. Yo te di yo: “Annou bati ansanm avèk nou, paske nou, kon ou menm, ap chache Bondye pa ou a. Nou t ap fè sakrifis a Li menm soti nan jou a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 19:37">II Wa 19:37</ref></char></note> Ésar-Haddon, wa Assyrie a, ki te mennen nou monte isit la.”<verse eid="EZR 4:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 4:3"/>Men Zorobabel avèk Josué ak tout lòt chèf a lakay zansèt a Israël yo te di yo: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 2:20">Né 2:20</ref></char></note> “Ou pa gen anyen ansanm avèk nou menm nan bati yon kay a Bondye nou an, men nou menm pou kont nou, nou va bati a SENYÈ a, Bondye Israël la, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 1:1">Esd 1:1</ref>,<ref loc="EZR 1:2">2</ref></char></note>kon Cyrus, wa Perse la, te kòmande nou an.”<verse eid="EZR 4:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 4:4"/>Konsa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 3:3">Esd 3:3</ref></char></note> pèp peyi a te kòmanse dekouraje pèp Juda a, e te bay yo pwoblem bati a. <verse eid="EZR 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 4:5"/>Konsa yo te anplwaye konseye yo kont yo pou detounen pwòp bi pa yo pandan tout jou a Cyrus yo, wa Perse la, menm jis rive nan règn Darius la, wa Perse la. <verse eid="EZR 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 4:6"/>Alò nan règn <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 1:1">Est 1:1</ref></char></note> Assuérus la, nan kòmansman règn li a, yo te ekri yon akizasyon kont pèp Juda a avèk Jérusalem nan.<verse eid="EZR 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 4:7"/>Nan jou a Artaxerxès yo, Bischlam, Mithredath, Thabeel ak tout lòt kolèg pa yo te ekri a Artaxerxès, wa Perse la. Lèt la te ekri nan lang Amareyen e livre <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 18:26">II Wa 18:26</ref></char></note> nan lang Amareyen. <verse eid="EZR 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 4:8"/>Rehum, kòmandan an, avèk Schimchaï, grefye a, te ekri yon lèt kont Jérusalem a Wa Artaxerxès la, kon swivan. <verse eid="EZR 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 4:9"/>Alò, ekri pa Rehum, kòmandan an, avèk Schimchaï, avèk tout lòt kolèg yo, jij yo ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 5:6">Esd 5:6</ref></char></note> gouvènè lokal yo, ofisye yo, sekretè yo, mesye Érec yo, Babilonyen yo, mesye Suse yo, sa vle di, Elamit yo, <verse eid="EZR 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 4:10"/>ak tout lòt nasyon ke onorab e pwisan Onsappar te depòte e retabli nan vil Samarie ak nan tout lòt rejyon lòtbò rivyè Jourdain an. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 4:11-17">Esd 4:11-17</ref></char></note><verse eid="EZR 4:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 4:11"/>Alò, sa se yon kopi a lèt sila ke yo te voye ba li a:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="EZR 4:11"/>
  <para style="pi1" vid="EZR 4:11">“A wa Artaxerxès: Sèvitè ou yo, mesye nan rejyon lòtbò rivyè a.<verse eid="EZR 4:11"/></para>
  <para style="mi">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 4:12"/>Kite li vin rekonèt a wa a ke Jwif ki te monte soti kote ou te rive kote nou an Jérusalem. Yo ap rebati vil rebèl e mechan sa a e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 5:3-9">Esd 5:3-9</ref></char></note> ap fin fè miray avèk reparasyon fondasyon yo. <verse eid="EZR 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 4:13"/>Alò, kite wa a byen konnen, ke si vil sa a vin rebati, e miray yo konplete, yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 4:20">Esd 4:20</ref></char></note> p ap peye kontribisyon obligatwa pa yo ankò, ni tarif yo, ni frè lese pase yo, e sa va diminye fòs kès wa a. <verse eid="EZR 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZR 4:14"/>Alò, akoz nou nan sèvis palè a, e se pa pwòp pou nou ta wè derespektan kont wa a; pou sa a, nou te voye enfòme wa a, <verse eid="EZR 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZR 4:15"/>pou ou kab fè rechèch nan achiv a papa zansèt pa ou yo. Konsa, ou va dekouvri nan rekò ansyen yo ke vil sila a se yon vil rebelyon, ki konn fè donmaj a wa yo avèk pwovens yo, e ke yo te pwovoke revolisyon ladann nan tan pase yo. Se pou rezon sa a, ke vil sa a te vin detwi nèt konsa. <verse eid="EZR 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZR 4:16"/>Nou enfòme wa a ke si vil sa a rebati e miray yo konplete; akoz sa a, ou p ap ankò posede anyen nan pwovens lòtbò larivyè Jourdain an.”<verse eid="EZR 4:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZR 4:17"/>Wa a te voye reponn a Rehum, kòmandan a Schimschaï, grefye a ak tout lòt kolèg pa yo ki te rete Samarie, ak nan tout lòt pwovens ki te lòtbò Rivyè Jourdain an:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="EZR 4:17"/>
  <para style="mi" vid="EZR 4:17">Lapè.<verse eid="EZR 4:17"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZR 4:18"/>Dokiman ke nou te voye bannou an te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 8:8">Né 8:8</ref> </char></note> tradwi ak li devan m. <verse eid="EZR 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZR 4:19"/>Mwen te fè yon dekrè, rechèch te fèt e li te dekouvri ke vil sa a te konn leve kont wa yo nan jou pase yo, ke rebelyon avèk revolisyon te konn fèt ladann, <verse eid="EZR 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZR 4:20"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 4:21">I Wa 4:21</ref></char></note> ke wa pwisan pa yo te konn gouvène tout pwovens lòtbò larivyè yo e ke kontribisyon obligatwa yo, tarif yo, e lese pase yo te konn peye a yo menm. <verse eid="EZR 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZR 4:21"/>Pou sa, pibliye yon dekrè pou fè mesye sila yo sispann travay la pou vil sila a pa rebati jiskaske yon dekrè pibliye pa mwen menm. <verse eid="EZR 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZR 4:22"/>Veye ke nou pa lach nan akonpli bagay sa a. Poukisa nou ta kite donmaj ki p ap nan avantaj a wa yo vin plis?<verse eid="EZR 4:22"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZR 4:23"/>Depi lè kopi a dekrè a wa Artaxerxès te li devan Rehum avèk Schimschaï, grefye a avèk kolèg parèy a yo, yo te ale byen vit Jérusalem kote Jwif yo, e te fè yo sispann pa fòs a zam. <verse eid="EZR 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZR 4:24"/>Alò, travay lakay Bondye Jérusalem nan te sispann jis rive nan dezyèm ane a Darius, wa Perse la.<verse eid="EZR 4:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="EZR 5"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 5:1"/>Alò pwofèt yo, pwofèt <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HAG 1:1">Ag 1:1</ref></char></note> Agée avèk pwofèt <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 1:1">Za 1:1</ref></char></note>Zacharie, fis a Iddo a, te pwofetize a Jwif ki te Juda avèk Jérusalem. Yo te pwofetize nan non Bondye Israël la. <verse eid="EZR 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 5:2"/>Konsa, Zorobabel fis a Schealthiel la avèk Josué te leve, e te kòmanse rebati lakay Bondye ki Jérusalem nan, ansanm ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 6:14">Esd 6:14</ref></char></note>pwofèt Bondye yo ki te avèk yo pou bay yo soutyen.<verse eid="EZR 5:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 5:3"/>Nan lè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 6:6-13">Esd 6:6-13</ref></char></note> Thathnaï, gouvènè pwovens lòtbò Rivyè a e Schethar-Boznaï avèk kolèg parèy a yo, te vin kote yo, e te pale avèk yo konsa: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 1:3">Esd 1:3</ref> </char></note>“Se kilès ki te bay ou dekrè pou fin fè tanp sila a, e pou fin fè konstriksyon sila a?” <verse eid="EZR 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 5:4"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 5:10">Esd 5:10</ref></char></note> Anplis, yo te mande non a mesye yo ki t ap fè batisman sila a. <verse eid="EZR 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 5:5"/>Men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 7:6-28">Esd 7:6-28</ref></char></note> zye a Bondye pa yo te veye sou ansyen nan Jwif yo, e yo pa t fè yo sispann jiskaske yon rapò te sòti nan Darius, wa Perse la.<verse eid="EZR 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 5:6"/>Kopi a lèt ke Thathnaï, gouvènè lòtbò rivyè a, e Schethar-Boznaï avèk kolèg Arpacschad yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 4:9">Esd 4:9</ref></char></note> ki te lòtbò rivyè a, ke yo te voye a Darius, wa a. <verse eid="EZR 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 5:7"/>Yo te voye bay li yon rapò, e ladann, te ekri sa:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="EZR 5:7"/>
  <para style="mi" vid="EZR 5:7">A Darius, wa a; lapè avèk ou!<verse eid="EZR 5:7"/></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 5:8"/>Kite li rekonèt a wa a ke nou te ale nan pwovens a Juda a, vè kay a gran Bondye a, ki ap bati avèk wòch ki gwo, e travès yo ap poze nan mi li yo. Travay sila a ap avanse avèk gwo swen e ap byen reyisi nan men yo. <verse eid="EZR 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 5:9"/>Konsa, nou te kesyonen ansyen sila yo epi te mande yo konsa: “Kilès ki te bay ou dekrè pou rebati tanp sa a, e fini avèk konstriksyon sa a?” <verse eid="EZR 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 5:10"/>Anplis, nou te mande yo non yo pou nou ta kab fè ou konnen e ke nou ta kapab ekri non a mesye ki te chèf an tèt yo. <verse eid="EZR 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 5:11"/>Se konsa yo te reponn nou. Yo te di: “Nou se sèvitè a Bondye syèl la avèk tè a, e n ap rebati tanp ki te bati anpil ane pase yo, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 6:1-38">I Wa 6:1-38</ref></char></note> ke yon gran wa Israël te bati, e te fin acheve. <verse eid="EZR 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 5:12"/>Men akoz papa pa nou yo te pwovoke Bondye syèl la a lakòlè, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 25:8-11">II Wa 25:8-11</ref> </char></note> Li te livre yo nan men Nebucadnetsar, wa Babylone nan, Kaldeyen ki te detwi tanp sila a, e te mennen fè sòti tout pèp la jis rive Babylone. <verse eid="EZR 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 5:13"/>Sepandan, nan premye ane Cyrus la, wa Babylone nan, Wa Cyrus te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 1:1-4">Esd 1:1-4</ref></char></note> pibliye yon dekrè pou rebati kay Bondye sila a. <verse eid="EZR 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZR 5:14"/>Anplis, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 1:7">Esd 1:7</ref></char></note> zouti an ajan avèk lò lakay Bondye ke Nebucadnetsar te retire soti nan tanp Jérusalem nan pou te pote yo nan tanp Babylone nan. Menm sila yo, Cyrus te pran soti nan tanp Babylone nan, e yo te bay a yon nonm ki te rele Sheshbatsar, sila li te chwazi kon gouvènè a. <verse eid="EZR 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZR 5:15"/>Li te di li: ‘Pran zouti sila yo, ale depoze yo nan tanp Jérusalem nan, e kite kay Bondye a vin rebati nan plas li.’ <verse eid="EZR 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZR 5:16"/>Epi Sheshbatsar sila a te vin <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 3:8-10">Esd 3:8-10</ref></char></note>poze fondasyon kay Bondye a Jérusalem. Epi depi lè sa a, jis rive koulye a, li te anba konstriksyon men li poko fini.<verse eid="EZR 5:16"/></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZR 5:17"/>Alò, si sa ta fè wa a kontan, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 6:1-2">Esd 6:1-2</ref></char></note> kite yon rechèch fèt lakay trezorye wa a ki Babylone nan, ke si se konsa, yon dekrè te fèt pa Cyrus pou rebati kay Bondye sila a Jérusalem. Epi konsa, kite wa a voye bannou desizyon pa li sou ka sa a.”<verse eid="EZR 5:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="EZR 6"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 6:1"/>Wa Darius te pibliye yon dekrè e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 5:17">Esd 5:17</ref></char></note> yon rechèch te fèt nan achiv yo kote trezò yo te depoze Babylone nan. <verse eid="EZR 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 6:2"/>Nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 17:6">II Wa 17:6</ref></char></note> Achemetha, nan fò a, ki nan pwovens a Médie a, yo te twouve yon woulo, e ladann te ekri konsa kon yon rekòd anrejistre:<verse eid="EZR 6:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 6:3"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:3 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZR 1:1">Esd 1:1</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Nan premye ane a Wa Cyrus la, Cyrus, wa a, te pibliye yon dekrè: Sou kay Bondye nan Jérusalem nan, kite tanp kote sakrifis konn vin ofri yo vin rebati, e kite fondasyon li yo konsève, wotè ki swasant koude a e lajè ki swasant koude a <verse eid="EZR 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 6:4"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 6:36">I Wa 6:36</ref></char></note> avèk twa ranje gwo wòch taye ak yon ranje an bwa. Epi kite frè a peye soti nan trezò wa a. <verse eid="EZR 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 6:5"/>Anplis, kite <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 1:7">Esd 1:7</ref></char></note> zouti an lò avèk ajan ki pou lakay Bondye yo, ke Nebucadnetsar te pran soti nan tanp Jérusalem nan pou te pote Babylone nan, remèt e fè retounen nan plas yo nan tanp Jérusalem nan. Konsa, nou va depoze yo nan kay Bondye a.<verse eid="EZR 6:5"/></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 6:6"/>Alò, pou sa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 5:3">Esd 5:3</ref></char></note> Thathnaï, ou menm, gouvènè pwovens lòtbò rivyè a, Schethar-Boznaï avèk kòlèg parèy ou yo, ofisyèl nan pwovens lòtbò rivyè yo, rete lwen de la. <verse eid="EZR 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 6:7"/>Kite travay sila sou kay Bondye a kontinye; kite gouvènè a Jwif yo avèk ansyen a Jwif yo rebati lakay Bondye a sou sit anplasman li an. <verse eid="EZR 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 6:8"/>Anplis, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 6:4">Esd 6:4</ref></char></note> Mwen menm, Darius, ap bay yon dekrè sou sa nou gen pou fè pou ansyen sila yo nan Juda pou rekonstriksyon lakay Bondye sila a: Tout frè li se pou peye a pèp sila yo soti nan kès trezò ki sòti nan taks ki sòti nan pwovens lòtbò rivyè yo. Epi sa dwe fèt san fè reta. <verse eid="EZR 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 6:9"/>Nenpòt sa ki nesesè, ni jenn towo, belye, ni jenn mouton pou ofrann brile a Bondye syèl la, e ble, sèl, diven ak lwil onksyon, jan prèt Jérusalem yo mande a, fòk sa bay a yo chak jou san manke, <verse eid="EZR 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 6:10"/>pou yo kab ofri sakrifis agreyab a Bondye syèl la, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 7:23">Esd 7:23</ref></char></note> priye pou lavi a wa a avèk fis li yo. <verse eid="EZR 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 6:11"/>Epi mwen te pibliye yon lòd ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 7:26">Esd 7:26</ref></char></note> nenpòt moun ki vyole dekrè sa a, yon travès bwa va rache sou pwòp kay li, li va leve wo, e atache sou li. E lakay li va devni yon gwo pil fatra. <verse eid="EZR 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 6:12"/>Ke Bondye <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 12:5-11">Det 12:5-11</ref> </char></note> ki te fè non Li rete la, ta dechouke nenpòt wa oswa pèp ki ta leve men l chanje sa a pou li ta detwi kay Bondye sa a, Jérusalem. Mwen, Darius, te pase lòd sa a. Kite li akonpli avèk dilijans!<verse eid="EZR 6:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 6:13"/>Alò, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 6:6">Esd 6:6</ref></char></note> Thathnaï, gouvènè pwovens lòtbò rivyè a, Schethar-Boznaï, avèk kolèg parèy a yo te konfòme avèk dilijans a lòd sa a jan Wa Darius te voye bay li a.<verse eid="EZR 6:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZR 6:14"/>Epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 5:1-2">Esd 5:1-2</ref></char></note> ansyen pami Jwif yo te reyisi nan konstriksyon an selon asistans pwofesi ki t ap fèt pa Aggée avèk Zacharie yo, fis a Iddo a. Konsa, yo te fin bati selon lòd Bondye Israël la, dekrè a Cyrus la, Darius ak Artaxerxès, wa a Perse la. <verse eid="EZR 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZR 6:15"/>Tanp sa a te fini sou twazyèm jou nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 3:7">Est 3:7</ref></char></note> mwa Adar a. Li te nan sizyèm ane règn Wa Darius la.<verse eid="EZR 6:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZR 6:16"/>Epi fis Israël yo, prèt yo, Levit yo ak tout lòt moun egzil ki te retounen yo, te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 8:63">I Wa 8:63</ref></char></note> selebre dedikasyon kay Bondye sila a avèk jwa. <verse eid="EZR 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZR 6:17"/>Yo te ofri pou dedikasyon tanp Bondye sila a san towo, de-san belye, kat-san jenn mouton, e kon ofrann peche pou tout Israël la, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 8:35">Esd 8:35</ref></char></note> douz mal kabrit ki te koresponn a non tribi Israël yo. <verse eid="EZR 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZR 6:18"/>Epi yo te chwazi prèt yo a divizyon pa yo ak Levit yo nan lòd pa yo pou sèvis Bondye Jérusalem nan, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 3:6">Nonb 3:6</ref></char></note> jan sa ekri nan liv Moïse la.<verse eid="EZR 6:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZR 6:19"/>Moun egzil yo te obsève fèt Pak la nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:6">Egz 12:6</ref></char></note> katòzyèm jou nan premye mwa a. <verse eid="EZR 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZR 6:20"/>Paske prèt yo avèk Levit yo te fin pirifye yo ansanm, yo tout nan yo te pwòp. Epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 35:11">II Kwo 35:11</ref></char></note> yo te touye jenn mouton Pak la pou tout moun egzil yo, ni pou frè pa yo, prèt yo ak pou yo menm. <verse eid="EZR 6:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZR 6:21"/>Fis a Israël ki te retounen an egzil yo, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 9:2">Né 9:2</ref></char></note> tout sila ki te separe yo menm de lempite a nasyon nan peyi yo pou fè ansanm avèk yo, pou chache SENYÈ a, Bondye Israël la, te manje Pak la. <verse eid="EZR 6:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZR 6:22"/>Epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:15">Egz 12:15</ref></char></note> yo te obsève Fèt Pen San Ledven an pandan sèt jou avèk jwa, paske SENYÈ a te fè yo rejwi, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 7:27">Esd 7:27</ref> </char></note>te detounen kè a wa a Assyrie a vè yo pou ankouraje yo nan travay lakay Bondye a, Bondye Israël la.<verse eid="EZR 6:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="EZR 7"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 7:1"/>Alò, apre bagay sila yo, nan règn <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 7:12-21">Esd 7:12-21</ref></char></note> Artaxerxès la, wa Perse la, te monte Esdras, fis a Seraja a, fis a Azaria a, fis a Hilkija a, <verse eid="EZR 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 7:2"/>fis a Schallum nan, fis a Tsadok la, fis a Achithub la, <verse eid="EZR 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 7:3"/>fis a Amaria a, fis a Merajoth la, <verse eid="EZR 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 7:4"/>fis a Zerachja a, fis a Uzzi a, fis a Bukki a, <verse eid="EZR 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 7:5"/>fis a Abischura a, fis a Phinées a, fis a Éléazar a, fis a Aaron an, wo prèt la. <verse eid="EZR 7:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 7:6"/>Esdras sila a te monte soti Babylone e li te yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 7:11-21">Esd 7:11-21</ref></char></note> skrib avèk anpil konesans nan lalwa Moïse la, ke SENYÈ a, Bondye Israël la, te bay la. Epi wa a te bay li tout sa ke li te mande akoz men SENYÈ a, Bondye li a, te sou li. <verse eid="EZR 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 7:7"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 8:1-20">Esd 8:1-20</ref></char></note> Kèk nan fis Israël yo avèk kèk nan prèt yo, Levit yo, chantè yo, gadyen pòtay yo, ak sèvitè tanp yo, te monte Jérusalem nan setyèm ane a Wa Artaxerxès la. <verse eid="EZR 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 7:8"/>Li te vini Jérusalem nan senkyèm mwa a, ki te nan setyèm ane règn a Wa a. <verse eid="EZR 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 7:9"/>Paske nan premye jou nan premye mwa a, li te kòmanse monte soti Babylone; epi nan premye jou nan senkyèm mwa a, li te rive Jérusalem, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 7:6">Esd 7:6</ref></char></note> akoz bon men a Bondye pa li a te sou li. <verse eid="EZR 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 7:10"/>Paske Esdras te dedye kè li pou etidye lalwa SENYÈ a, pou pratike li, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 7:25">Esd 7:25</ref></char></note> pou enstwi règleman pa Li yo ak òdonans Li yo an Israël.<verse eid="EZR 7:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 7:11"/>Alò, sa se yon kopi a dekrè ke Wa Artaxerxès te bay a Esdras, prèt la, skrib la, ki te byen enstwi nan kòmandman a SENYÈ a, avèk règleman Li yo pou Israël:<verse eid="EZR 7:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="mi">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 7:12"/>“Artaxerxès, wadèwa yo, a Esdras, prèt la, skrib lalwa Bondye Syèl la, lapè pafè.</para>
  <para style="pi1" vid="EZR 7:12">Depi koulye a, <verse eid="EZR 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 7:13"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 6:1">Esd 6:1</ref></char></note> mwen te bay yon dekrè ke nenpòt moun nan pèp Israël la avèk prèt pa yo ak Levit nan wayòm pa m nan ki gen volonte pou ale Jérusalem, kapab ale avèk ou. <verse eid="EZR 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZR 7:14"/>Akoz ke ou voye pa wa a avèk <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 7:15-28">Esd 7:15-28</ref></char></note> sèt konseye li yo, pou mande konsèy sou Juda ak Jérusalem, selon lalwa Bondye pa ou a, ki nan men ou a, <verse eid="EZR 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZR 7:15"/>epi pou pote ajan avèk lò ke wa a avèk konseye li yo te ofri libreman a Bondye Israël la, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 6:12">Esd 6:12</ref></char></note> ki gen plas abitasyon Li Jérusalem, <verse eid="EZR 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZR 7:16"/>avèk tout ajan ak lò ke ou jwenn nan tout pwovens Babylone yo, ansanm <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 1:4">Esd 1:4</ref></char></note> avèk ofrann bòn volonte a pèp la ak prèt yo, ki te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 29:6">I Kwo 29:6</ref></char></note>ofri avèk bòn volonte pou lakay Bondye pa yo a ki Jérusalem nan. <verse eid="EZR 7:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZR 7:17"/>Pou sa, avèk lajan sa a, nou va, avèk swen, achte towo, belye, jenn mouton avèk ofrann sereyal pa yo ak ofrann bwason pa yo, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 12:5-11">Det 12:5-11</ref></char></note> ofri yo sou lotèl lakay Bondye nou an ki Jérusalem nan. <verse eid="EZR 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZR 7:18"/>Nenpòt sa ou wè ki sanble bon a ou menm avèk frè ou yo pou fè avèk sa ki rete nan ajan avèk lò yo, nou kab fè l selon volonte Bondye pa nou an. <verse eid="EZR 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZR 7:19"/>Anplis, zouti ki bay a nou pou sèvis lakay Bondye ou a, livre yo nèt devan Bondye Jérusalem nan. <verse eid="EZR 7:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZR 7:20"/>Tout lòt bezwen pou lakay Bondye ou a, ke ou kab petèt gen okazyon founi, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 6:4">Esd 6:4</ref></char></note> founi li soti nan kès trezò wa a. <verse eid="EZR 7:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZR 7:21"/>Mwen, mwen menm, Wa Artaxerxès, pibliye yon dekrè a tout trezorye ki nan pwovens lòtbò rivyè a, ke nenpòt sa ke Esdras, prèt la, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 7:6">Esd 7:6</ref></char></note> skrib lalwa a Bondye syèl la a ta egzije a nou, fòk li fèt avèk swen, <verse eid="EZR 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZR 7:22"/>jis menm rive a san talan ajan, san barik ble, san galon diven, san galon lwil, avèk sèl si li ta nesesè. <verse eid="EZR 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZR 7:23"/>Nenpòt sa ki kòmande pa Bondye syèl la, kite li fèt avèk zèl pou lakay Bondye syèl la, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 6:10">Esd 6:10</ref></char></note> pou pa vin genyen kòlè Li kont wayòm a wa a avèk fis li yo.<verse eid="EZR 7:23"/></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZR 7:24"/>Anplis, nou fè nou konprann ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 4:13-20">Esd 4:13-20</ref></char></note> li pa pèmèt pou enpoze taks, kontribisyon obligatwa, ni frè lese pase sou okenn nan prèt yo, Levit yo, chantè yo, gadyen pòtay yo, Netinyen yo, ni sèvitè lakay Bondye sila a.<verse eid="EZR 7:24"/></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZR 7:25"/>Ou menm, Esdras, selon sajès a Bondye ki nan men ou a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 18:21">Egz 18:21</ref></char></note> chwazi majistra yo avèk jij yo pou yo kab jije tout moun ki nan pwovens lòtbò rivyè a, menm tout sila ki konnen lalwa a Bondye pa ou a; epi ou kapab <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAL 2:7">Mal 2:7</ref></char></note>enstwi nenpòt moun ki manke konprann. <verse eid="EZR 7:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZR 7:26"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 6:11-12">Esd 6:11-12</ref></char></note> Nenpòt moun ki refize obsève lalwa Bondye ou a, avèk lalwa a wa a, kite jijman vin tonbe sou li avèk severite, swa pou lanmò, swa mete l deyò nan peyi a, swa sezi byen li, oswa ba li prizon.”<verse eid="EZR 7:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZR 7:27"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:27 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZR 6:22">Esd 6:22</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Beni se SENYÈ a, Bondye a papa zansèt nou yo, ki te mete yon bagay konsa nan kè a wa a, pou fè bèl kay SENYÈ a ki Jérusalem nan; <verse eid="EZR 7:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZR 7:28"/>epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 9:9">Esd 9:9</ref></char></note> te lonje bay lanmou dous Li a mwen menm devan wa a avèk konseye li yo e devan tout chèf pwisan a wa yo. Se te konsa mwen te ranfòse pa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 5:5">Esd 5:5</ref> </char></note>men SENYÈ a, Bondye mwen an, ki te sou mwen an, e mwen te rasanble mesye dirijan prensipal yo soti an Israël pou monte avè m.<verse eid="EZR 7:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="EZR 8"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 8:1"/>Alò sila yo se chèf lakay papa zansèt yo, e anrejistreman a sila ki te monte avè m soti Babylone yo nan règn Wa Artaxerxès la:<verse eid="EZR 8:1"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 8:2"/>Nan fis a Phinées yo, Guerschom.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="EZR 8:2">Nan fis a Ithamar yo, Daniel.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="EZR 8:2">Nan fis a David yo, Hatthusch.<verse eid="EZR 8:2"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 8:3"/>Nan fis a Schecania yo ki te nan fis a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 2:3">Esd 2:3</ref></char></note>Pareosch yo, Zacharie e avèk li, san-senkant gason ki te nan chif rejis la.<verse eid="EZR 8:3"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 8:4"/>Nan fis a Pachat-Moab yo, Eljoénaï, fis a Zerachja a, epi avèk li menm, de-san gason.<verse eid="EZR 8:4"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 8:5"/>Nan fis a Tsatttu yo, Schecania, fis a Jachaziel la e avèk li, twa-san gason.<verse eid="EZR 8:5"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 8:6"/>Nan fis a Adin yo, Ébed, fis a Jonathan an e senkant gason avèk li.<verse eid="EZR 8:6"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 8:7"/>Nan fis a Élam yo, Ésaïe, fis a Athalia a e avèk li, swasann-dis gason.<verse eid="EZR 8:7"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 8:8"/>Nan fis a Schephathia yo, Zebadia, fis a Micaël la e avèk li, katra-ven gason.<verse eid="EZR 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 8:9"/>Nan fis a Joab yo, Abdias, fis a Jehiel la e avèk li, de-san di-zuit gason.<verse eid="EZR 8:9"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 8:10"/>Nan fis Schelomith yo, fis a Josiphia yo e avèk li, san-swasant gason.<verse eid="EZR 8:10"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 8:11"/>Nan fis a Bébaï yo, Zacharie, fis a Bébaï a e avèk li, venn-tuit gason.<verse eid="EZR 8:11"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 8:12"/>Nan fis a Azgad yo, Jochanan, fis a Hakkathan an e avèk li, san-dis gason.<verse eid="EZR 8:12"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 8:13"/>Nan fis a Adonikam yo, dènye yo, men non yo, Éliphéleth, Jeiel ak Schemaeja e avèk li, swasant gason.<verse eid="EZR 8:13"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZR 8:14"/>Nan fis a Bigvaï yo, Uthaï ak Zabbud e avèk yo, swasann-dis gason.<verse eid="EZR 8:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZR 8:15"/>Alò, mwen te rasanble yo akote <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 8:21-31">Esd 8:21-31</ref></char></note> rivyè ki kouri rive Ahava a, kote nou te fè kan pandan twa jou. Epi lè mwen te obsève pèp la avèk prèt yo, mwen pa t twouve okenn nan Levit yo la. <verse eid="EZR 8:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZR 8:16"/>Akoz sa, mwen te voye pou chèf yo Éliézer, Ariel, Schemaeja, Elnathan, Jarib, Elnathan, Nathan, Zacharie ak Meschullam e pwofesè yo, Jojarib avèk Einathan. <verse eid="EZR 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZR 8:17"/>Mwen te voye yo kote Iddo, chèf prensipal nan andwa Casiphia a; epi mwen te fè yo konnen kisa pou yo di Iddo avèk frè li yo, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 2:43">Esd 2:43</ref></char></note> sèvitè tanp yo nan andwa Casiphia a, sa vle di pou pote sèvitè yo kote nou pou lakay Bondye pa nou an. <verse eid="EZR 8:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZR 8:18"/>Selon bon men SENYÈ a sou nou, yo te mennen bannou yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 30:22">II Kwo 30:22</ref></char></note> nonm ak anpil konprann nan fis a Machli yo, fis a Lévi a, fis Israël la, ki rele Schérébia ak fis li yo avèk frè li yo, di-zuit mesye; <verse eid="EZR 8:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZR 8:19"/>epi Haschabia e avèk li, Ésaïe nan fis a Merari yo, avèk frè li yo ak fis li yo, ven; <verse eid="EZR 8:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZR 8:20"/>epi de-san-ven nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 2:43">Esd 2:43</ref></char></note> sèvitè tanp yo, ke David avèk chèf yo te bay pou sèvis Levit yo, tout moun ki te dezigne pa non yo.<verse eid="EZR 8:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZR 8:21"/>Epi mwen te pwoklame yon jèn, akote rivyè Ahava a, pou nou ta kab <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 16:29">Lev 16:29</ref></char></note> imilye nou devan Bondye nou an pou chache soti nan Li, yon vwayaj sof pou nou, pitit nou yo ak tout byen nou yo. <verse eid="EZR 8:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZR 8:22"/>Paske mwen te wont mande a wa a, sòlda yo avèk chevalye yo pou pwoteje nou kont lènmi sou chemen an, akoz nou te di a wa a: “Men Bondye nou an byen dispoze sou sila ki chache Li yo, men ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 22:16">Jos 22:16</ref></char></note> pwisans Li avèk lakòlè Li kont tout sila ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 15:2">II Kwo 15:2</ref></char></note>abandone Li yo.” <verse eid="EZR 8:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZR 8:23"/>Konsa, nou te fè jèn nan, e te chache Bondye nou konsa, e Li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 5:20">I Kwo 5:20</ref></char></note> koute sa nou te mande a.<verse eid="EZR 8:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZR 8:24"/>Konsa, mwen te mete akote douz nan prèt prensipal yo, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 8:18-19">Esd 8:18-19</ref></char></note> Schébéria, Haschabia ak dis nan frè yo. <verse eid="EZR 8:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZR 8:25"/>Epi mwen te peze bay yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 7:15-16">Esd 7:15-16</ref></char></note> ajan, lò, avèk zouti, ofrann pou lakay Bondye nou an, ke wa a avèk konseye li yo ak chèf li yo avèk tout Israël prezan yo, te bay. <verse eid="EZR 8:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZR 8:26"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 1:9-11">Esd 1:9-11</ref></char></note> Konsa, mwen te peze mete nan men yo sis-san-senkant talan ajan, zouti an ajan ki te gen valè a san talan e anplis, san talan lò, <verse eid="EZR 8:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZR 8:27"/>ven bòl an lò ki te gen valè mil darik yo, ak de zouti an bwonz klè, byen fen, presye kon lò. <verse eid="EZR 8:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZR 8:28"/>Mwen te di yo: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 21:6-8">Lev 21:6-8</ref></char></note> “Nou sen a SENYÈ la, e tout zouti yo sen. Epi ajan avèk lò a se yon ofrann bòn volonte a SENYÈ a, Bondye a zansèt nou yo. <verse eid="EZR 8:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZR 8:29"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 8:33-34">Esd 8:33-34</ref></char></note> Veye e kenbe yo jiskaske nou peze yo devan prèt prensipal yo, Levit yo ak chèf an tèt lakay zansèt a Israël nou yo Jérusalem, nan chanm lakay SENYÈ yo.”<verse eid="EZR 8:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZR 8:30"/>Konsa, prèt yo avèk Levit yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 1:9">Esd 1:9</ref></char></note> aksepte ajan avèk lò ki te fin peze yo ak zouti yo pou pote yo Jérusalem lakay Bondye pa nou an.<verse eid="EZR 8:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZR 8:31"/>Epi nou te vwayaje soti nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 8:15-21">Esd 8:15-21</ref></char></note> rivyè Ahava a nan douzyèm jou nan premye mwa a pou monte Jérusalem. Lamen Bondye nou an te sou nou, e Li te delivre nou soti nan men a lènmi yo, ak anbiskad nan chemen yo. <verse eid="EZR 8:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EZR 8:32"/>Konsa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 2:11">Né 2:11</ref></char></note> nou te rive Jérusalem e te rete la pandan twa jou. <verse eid="EZR 8:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EZR 8:33"/>Nan katriyèm jou a, ajan an avèk lò a avèk zouti ki te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 8:30">Esd 8:30</ref></char></note> peze pa men a Merémoth la, fis a Urie a, prèt la, e avèk li, te gen Éléazar, fis a Phinées; epi avèk yo, te gen Levit yo, Jozabad, fis a Josué a ak Noadia, fis a Binnui a. <verse eid="EZR 8:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EZR 8:34"/>Tout bagay te nimewote e te peze, e tout pwa a te rekòde menm lè sa a.<verse eid="EZR 8:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="EZR 8:35"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:35 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZR 2:1">Esd 2:1</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Moun egzil ki te sòti an kaptivite yo te ofri ofrann brile a Bondye Israël la: douz towo pou tout Israël, katre-ven-sèz belye, swasann-dis-sèt jenn mouton, douz mal kabrit kon ofrann peche. Yo tout te kon yon ofrann brile a SENYÈ a. <verse eid="EZR 8:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EZR 8:36"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 7:21-24">Esd 7:21-24</ref></char></note> Yo te livre dekrè a wa a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 4:7">Esd 4:7</ref> </char></note>chèf pwovens yo, e a majistra lòtbò rivyè Jourdain an. Konsa, yo te bay soutyen a pèp la avèk lakay Bondye a.<verse eid="EZR 8:36"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="EZR 9"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 9:1"/>Alò, lè bagay sa yo te fini, chèf yo te vin kote mwen epi te di: “Pèp Israël la avèk prèt ak Levit yo pa t separe yo menm de pèp peyi yo, men te swiv<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 18:24-30">Lev 18:24-30</ref></char></note> abominasyon pa yo, menm sila nan Canaan yo, Etyen yo, Ferezyen yo, Jebizyen yo, Amonit yo, Moabit yo, Ejipsyen yo ak Amoreyen yo. <verse eid="EZR 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 9:2"/>Paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 7:3">Det 7:3</ref></char></note> yo te pran kèk nan fi pa yo kon madanm pou yo menm, ak pou fis pa yo, jiskaske ras sen an te vin mele avèk pèp peyi yo. Vrèman, se men a chèf yo avèk dirijan yo ki te pran an avan nan enfidelite sa a.”<verse eid="EZR 9:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 9:3"/>Lè mwen te tande afè sila a, mwen te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 18:37">II Wa 18:37</ref></char></note> chire vètman mwen. Mwen te rache cheve nan tèt mwen avèk bab mwen e mwen te vin <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 1:4">Né 1:4</ref></char></note>chita, dezole nèt. <verse eid="EZR 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 9:4"/>Konsa, tout moun ki te tranble sou pawòl Bondye Israël la akoz enfidelite a moun egzil yo, te rasanble kote mwen. Epi mwen te chita dezole nèt jis rive nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 29:39">Egz 29:39</ref></char></note> ofrann aswè a.<verse eid="EZR 9:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 9:5"/>Men nan ofrann aswè a, mwen te leve soti nan imilyasyon mwen, menm avèk rad ak manto mwen chire. Mwen te tonbe sou jenou mwen e te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 9:29">Egz 9:29</ref></char></note> lonje men m kote SENYÈ a, Bondye mwen an. <verse eid="EZR 9:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 9:6"/>Mwen te di: “O Bondye mwen, mwen twouble, e mwen wont leve figi mwen vè Ou menm, Bondye mwen. Paske inikite nou yo vin leve pi wo tèt nou, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 9:13-15">Esd 9:13-15</ref></char></note> koupabilite nou vin grandi menm jis rive nan syèl yo. <verse eid="EZR 9:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 9:7"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 29:6">II Kwo 29:6</ref></char></note> Depi nan jou a papa nou yo, jis rive jodi a, nou nan gran koupabilite. Epi akoz inikite nou yo, nou menm, wa nou yo ak prèt nou yo te vin livre nan men a wa peyi yo, a nepe, an kaptivite, piyaj ak wont ki byen vizib, jis rive jodi a. <verse eid="EZR 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 9:8"/>Men koulye a, pou yon ti moman, gras la te parèt soti nan SENYÈ a, Bondye nou an, pou kite pou nou, yon retay ki chape, pou bay nou yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 22:23">És 22:23</ref></char></note> pati nan kote sen Li an, pou Bondye nou an ta kapab <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 13:3">Sòm 13:3</ref></char></note>klere zye nou e fè nou twouve yon ti amelyorasyon nan esklavaj nou an. <verse eid="EZR 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 9:9"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 9:36">Né 9:36</ref></char></note> Paske se esklav nou ye; sepandan, Bondye pa t abandone nou, men te lonje ban nou lanmou dous Li nan zye a wa Perse yo, pou bannou amelyorasyon pou leve lakay Bondye nou an, pou restore sa ki te kraze nèt yo, e pou bannou yon miray nan Juda avèk Jérusalem.<verse eid="EZR 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 9:10"/>“Alò, Bondye nou an, kisa nou va di apre sa? Paske nou te abandone kòmandman Ou yo, <verse eid="EZR 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 9:11"/>ke Ou te kòmande pa sèvitè Ou yo, pwofèt yo, lè Ou te di: ‘Peyi ke nou ap antre pou posede a se yon peyi ki pa pwòp avèk moun ki pa pwòp nan peyi yo, avèk abominasyon pa yo avèk sila yo te akonpli soti nan yon pwent jis rive nan yon lòt <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 6:21">Esd 6:21</ref></char></note> ak lempite pa yo. <verse eid="EZR 9:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 9:12"/>Pou sa, pa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 34:15-16">Egz 34:15-16</ref></char></note> bay fi nou yo a fis nou yo, ni pran fi pa yo pou fis pa nou, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 23:6">Det 23:6</ref></char></note>pa janm chache lapè yo ak pwosperite yo, pou nou kapab kenbe kouraj nou e manje bon bagay peyi a, e lese li kon yon eritaj a fis nou yo jis pou tout tan.’<verse eid="EZR 9:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 9:13"/>“Apre tout sa ki te rive sou nou pou zak mechan nou yo ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 9:6-7">Esd 9:6-7</ref> </char></note> gran koupabilite nou yo, akoz Ou menm, Bondye nou an, te remèt nou mwens ke linikite nou yo merite, e te ban nou yon retay chape kon sila a, <verse eid="EZR 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZR 9:14"/>konsa, èske nou ap ankò kraze kòmandman Ou yo, e fè maryaj ak pèp ki fè abominasyon sila yo? <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 9:8-14">Det 9:8-14</ref></char></note> Èske Ou pa t ap fache avèk nou jis nan pwen pou detwi nou, jis pa menm gen yon retay, ni okenn moun ki chape? <verse eid="EZR 9:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZR 9:15"/>O SENYÈ a, Bondye Israël la, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 9:33">Né 9:33</ref></char></note> Ou dwat, paske yon retay ki chape te rete pou nou nan jou sa a. Men vwala, nou devan Ou nan koupabilite nou yo, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 130:3">Sòm 130:3</ref> </char></note>pèsòn pa kapab kanpe devan Ou akoz sa.”<verse eid="EZR 9:15"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="EZR 10"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 10:1"/>Alò, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 9:4-20">Dan 9:4-20</ref></char></note> pandan Esdras t ap priye e t ap fè konfesyon, t ap kriye e pwostène li devan lakay Bondye a, yon trè gran asanble, gason, fanm, ni timoun, te rasanble vè li soti an Israël; paske pèp yo te kriye byen anmè. <verse eid="EZR 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 10:2"/>Schecania, fis a Jehiel la, youn nan fis a Élam yo, te di Esdras: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 9:2">Esd 9:2</ref></char></note> “Nou pa t fidèl a Bondye nou an. Nou te marye ak fanm etranje soti nan pèp peyi yo. Malgre, koulye a toujou gen espwa pou Israël. <verse eid="EZR 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 10:3"/>Alò pou sa a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 34:31">II Kwo 34:31</ref></char></note> kite nou fè yon akò avèk Bondye nou an pou mete akote tout fanm yo avèk pitit pa yo, selon konsèy a mèt mwen an, e pou sila ki tranble sou kòmandman Bondye nou yo. Epi kite sa fèt <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 7:2-3">Det 7:2-3</ref></char></note>selon lalwa a. <verse eid="EZR 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 10:4"/>Leve! Paske se ou menm ki responsab afè sila a, men nou va avèk nou. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 28:10">I Kwo 28:10</ref></char></note> Pran kouraj e aji.”<verse eid="EZR 10:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 10:5"/>Konsa, Esdras te leve, e te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 5:12">Né 5:12</ref></char></note> fè prèt prensipal yo, Levit yo ak tout Israël sèmante pou yo ta fè selon sa ki te pwopoze a. Konsa yo te sèmante. <verse eid="EZR 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 10:6"/>Epi Esdras te leve soti devan lakay Bondye a, e te antre nan chanm a Jochanan nan, fis a Éliaschib la. Malgre li te ale la, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 9:18">Det 9:18</ref> </char></note> li pa t manje pen, ni bwè dlo, paske li te tèlman dezole akoz enfidelite a moun egzil yo. <verse eid="EZR 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 10:7"/>Yo te fè yon dekrè nan tout Juda avèk Jérusalem a tout moun egzil yo, ke yo ta dwe rasanble Jérusalem, <verse eid="EZR 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 10:8"/>epi ke nenpòt moun ki pa ta vini nan twa jou yo, selon konsèy a chèf pa yo avèk ansyen yo, tout byen li yo va konfiske e li menm ta retire nan asanble moun egzil yo.<verse eid="EZR 10:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 10:9"/>Pou sa, tout mesye Juda avèk Benjamin yo te rasanble Jérusalem nan twa jou yo. Se te nan nevyèm mwa a sou ventyèm jou nan mwa a, tout pèp te chita nan plas ouvri devan lakay Bondye a, e yo t ap <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 12:18">I Sam 12:18</ref></char></note> tranble akoz afè sila a ak gwo lapli a.<verse eid="EZR 10:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 10:10"/>Alò, Esdras, prèt la, te kanpe epi te di yo: “Nou pa t fidèl e nou te marye avèk fanm etranje yo, ki ogmante koupabilite Israël la. <verse eid="EZR 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 10:11"/>Alò, akoz sa a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 26:40">Lev 26:40</ref></char></note> konfese a SENYÈ a, Bondye a zansèt nou yo, e fè volonte L. Separe nou menm soti nan moun a peyi yo, e separe nou de madanm etranje yo.”<verse eid="EZR 10:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 10:12"/>Konsa, tout asanble a te reponn ak yon gwo vwa: “Se konsa, jan ou te di a, se devwa nou pou nou fè. <verse eid="EZR 10:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 10:13"/>Men gen anpil moun, se sezon lapli a, e nou p ap kab kanpe deyò a. Ni tach la pa kab fèt nan youn oswa de jou, paske nou te fè anpil transgresyon nan afè sila a. <verse eid="EZR 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZR 10:14"/>Kite chèf nou yo reprezante tout asanble a, e kite tout sila nan vil nou yo ki te marye ak fanm etranje yo vini nan lè apwente yo, ansanm avèk ansyen a chak vil yo, jiskaske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 23:26">II Wa 23:26</ref></char></note> kòlè fewòs Bondye nou an, akoz bagay sa a, ta vin detounen kite nou.”<verse eid="EZR 10:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZR 10:15"/>Sèlman Jonathan, fis Asël la avèk Jachzia, fis a Thikva a, te opoze ak sa, avèk Meschullam avèk Schabthaï, Levit ki t ap bay yo soutyen an.<verse eid="EZR 10:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZR 10:16"/>Men moun egzil yo te fè li konsa. Epi Esdras, prèt la, te chwazi mesye ki te chèf an tèt lakay zansèt yo pou chak kay zansèt, yo tout pa non yo. Konsa, yo te reyini nan premye jou nan dizyèm mwa a pou fè rechèch sou ka sila a. <verse eid="EZR 10:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZR 10:17"/>Yo te fin fè rechèch la sou tout mesye ki te marye ak fanm etranje yo pou rive nan premye jou premye mwa a.<verse eid="EZR 10:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZR 10:18"/>Pami fis a prèt ki te marye ak fanm etranje yo,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="EZR 10:18">yo te twouve fis a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HAG 1:1-12">Ag 1:1-12</ref></char></note> Josué yo, fis a Jotsadak la e frè li yo: Maaséja, Éliézer, Jarib, avèk Guedalia. <verse eid="EZR 10:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZR 10:19"/>Yo te fè sèman pou mete akote fanm pa yo e akoz koupabilite a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 5:15">Lev 5:15</ref></char></note> yo te ofri yon belye a bann mouton an pou kouvri koupabilite yo.<verse eid="EZR 10:19"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZR 10:20"/>Nan fis a Immer yo, te gen Hanani avèk Zebadia;<verse eid="EZR 10:20"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZR 10:21"/>Nan fis a Harim yo, Masséja, Élie, Schemaeja, Jehiel, avèk Ozias.<verse eid="EZR 10:21"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZR 10:22"/>Nan fis a Paschhur yo, Eljoénaï, Maaséja, Ismaël, Nethaneel, Jozabad, avèk Éleasa.<verse eid="EZR 10:22"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZR 10:23"/>Nan Levit yo, te gen Jozabad, Schimeï, Kélaja, (sa vle di) Kelitha, Pethachja, Juda, avèk Éliézer.<verse eid="EZR 10:23"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZR 10:24"/>Pami chantè yo, te gen Éliaschab.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="EZR 10:24">Pami gadyen pòtay yo: Schallum, Thélem ak Uri.<verse eid="EZR 10:24"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZR 10:25"/>Nan Israël, nan fis a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 2:3">Esd 2:3</ref></char></note> Pareosch yo: Ramia, Jizzija, Malkija, Mijamin, Éléazar, Malkija ak Benaja.<verse eid="EZR 10:25"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZR 10:26"/>Nan fis a Élam yo: Matthania, Zacharie, Jehiel, Abdi, Jerémoth, avèk Élie.<verse eid="EZR 10:26"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZR 10:27"/>Nan fis a Zatthu yo: Elojénaï, Éliaschib, Matthania, Jerémoth, Zabad, epi Aziza.<verse eid="EZR 10:27"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZR 10:28"/>Nan fis a Bébaï yo: Jochanan, Hanania, Zabbaï, avèk Athlaï.<verse eid="EZR 10:28"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZR 10:29"/>Nan fis a Bani yo: Meschullam, Malluc, Adaja, Jaschub, Scheal, avèk Ramoth.<verse eid="EZR 10:29"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZR 10:30"/>Nan fis a Pachath-Moab yo: Adna, Kelal, Benaja, Maaséja, Matthania, Betsaleel, Binnuï avèk Manassé.<verse eid="EZR 10:30"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZR 10:31"/>Nan fis a Harim yo: Éliézer, Jischija, Malkija, Schemaeja, Siméon. <verse eid="EZR 10:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EZR 10:32"/>Benjamin, Malluc avèk Schemaria.<verse eid="EZR 10:32"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="EZR 10:33"/>Nan fis yo a Haschum: Matthanaï, Matthattha, Zabad, Éliphéleth, Jerémaï, Manassé avèk Schimeï.<verse eid="EZR 10:33"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="EZR 10:34"/>Nan fis a Bani yo, Maadaï, Amram, Uel, <verse eid="EZR 10:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EZR 10:35"/>Benaja, Bédia, Keluhu, <verse eid="EZR 10:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EZR 10:36"/>Vania, Merémoth, Éliaschib, <verse eid="EZR 10:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EZR 10:37"/>Matthania, Matthanaï, Jaasaï, <verse eid="EZR 10:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EZR 10:38"/>Bani, Binnuï, Schimeï, <verse eid="EZR 10:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="EZR 10:39"/>Schélémia, Nathan, Adaja, <verse eid="EZR 10:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="EZR 10:40"/>Macnadbaï, Schaschaï, Scharaï, <verse eid="EZR 10:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="EZR 10:41"/>Azareel, Schélémia, Schemaria, <verse eid="EZR 10:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="EZR 10:42"/>Schallum, Amaria, avèk Joseph.<verse eid="EZR 10:42"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="EZR 10:43"/>Nan fis a Nebo yo, Jeïel, Matthithia, Zabad, Zebina, Jaddaï, Joël ak Benaja.<verse eid="EZR 10:43"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="EZR 10:44"/>Tout nan sila yo te marye avèk <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:44 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 11:1-3">I Wa 11:1-3</ref></char></note> fanm etranje yo e te gen nan yo ki te gen fanm avèk sila yo te fè pitit.<verse eid="EZR 10:44"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 10"/>
</usx>
